on":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"zDoPlBQTou"}],"identifier":"id","label":"单细胞最佳实践","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"R93hRfM6nM"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"介绍","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"Xu6msOMKqT"}],"identifier":"introduction","label":"Introduction","html_id":"introduction","implicit":true,"key":"HqwGY3rkyn"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人体是一台复杂的机器，高度依赖于生命的基本单位——细胞。这些细胞展现出非凡的多样性，类型和功能各不相同，并能在发育过程中、应对疾病时或再生过程中发生重要的状态转变。这种细胞异质性（cellular heterogeneity）体现在它们的结构、功能和基因表达谱上。一旦这种微妙的平衡被打破，便可能导致全身性的失调，进而引发癌症等严重疾病 ","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"VpgePzc9Ru"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"Macaulay2017","identifier":"macaulay2017","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Macaulay ","key":"OO0MRyNF8M"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"gaCIxce87C"}],"key":"T9tzu5PTvB"},{"type":"text","value":", 2017","key":"DSd9DYxlV4"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"BjE0gewa8R"}],"key":"KTKEn9FsL7"},{"type":"text","value":"。因此，理解细胞在正常和扰动状态下如何运作，对于深化我们对整个细胞系统的认识至关重要。","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"h34spDA0V8"}],"key":"xw0NoZoUId"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"为应对这一挑战，研究人员采用了多种策略，其中最有前景的方法之一是在单个细胞水平上对细胞进行剖析。传统上，每个细胞的转录组（transcriptome）主要通过一种称为单细胞 RNA ","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"Qq4bAWiMf9"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"sequencing","identifier":"term-sequencing","children":[{"type":"text","value":"测序（single-cell RNA sequencing, scRNA-seq）","key":"X8ezBGHgo5"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-sequencing","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"bXXi5Lb8qE"},{"type":"text","value":" 的过程来研究。然而，单细胞基因组学近来的进展如今已能将转录组数据与空间信息、染色质可及性（chromatin accessibility）或蛋白质水平信息整合起来。这些进展不仅加深了我们对复杂调控机制的理解，也为数据分析带来了新的挑战。","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"QaS9Xi6JqS"}],"key":"jAexYBurbX"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"如今，分析人员面临着数量惊人的计算工具——仅针对单细胞 RNA-seq 的方法就超过 1700 种 ","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"f35puZiWmq"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"Zappia2021_pre","identifier":"zappia2021_pre","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Zappia & Theis, 2021","key":"vJeVwvMrck"}],"enumerator":"2","key":"FCCr4peh9Q"}],"key":"Jmj4FRP4AA"},{"type":"text","value":"。要在如此庞大的工具版图中找准方向、产出可靠而前沿的结果，是一项重大的挑战。","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"FlM2s1tqab"}],"key":"BUU1xTJqTi"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本书涵盖的内容","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"key":"eOdz9CxtP2"}],"identifier":"what-this-book-covers","label":"What this book covers","html_id":"what-this-book-covers","implicit":true,"key":"KKQcLq2wg1"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本书旨在指导初学者和经验丰富的专业人士掌握单细胞测序分析的 ","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"key":"MPUGR8N4hJ"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"最佳实践","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28